<title>GERMANY: GERMAN FEB IMPORT PRICES +0.5 M/M, UP 3.0 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>GERMAN FEB IMPORT PRICES +0.5 M/M, UP 3.0 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    Feb 97	Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.5	  +1.0	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +3.0	  +2.6	 -0.8</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991)  100.5	 100.0	97.6</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.3	  +0.4	 +0.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +0.8	  +0.5	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 104.2	 103.9	103.2</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
